# DORA deploy (mandatory)

Every **successful push** to the tracked remote must be registered in Archsphere as a completed **`kind: deploy`** task (`implant_task`) so **Deployment Frequency (DF)** metrics stay accurate.

## When to act

| Moment | Action |
|--------|--------|
| **Before editing** (work may ship) | Phase 1: `create_task` `kind: deploy`, `status: pending` — track `deployTaskId` |
| **After successful push** | Phase 2: `update_task` metadata → **`implant_task`** → `append_logbook_entry` |

## What counts as a delivery

- Library code, tests, deps, docs, **agent config** (`.cursor/`, skills, `AGENTS.md`), chore — **all count**
- **Do not skip** because the change is “not production app code”

## Opt-out

Skip DORA registration **only** when the user **explicitly** says the push must not count (WIP branch, throwaway remote, “não contabilizar DORA”).

